much of anything


00:20:26.876 --> 00:20:28.251
or doesn't want to know.


00:20:28.417 --> 00:20:31.751
It seems you're not aware of
how frustrating is not finding a job.


00:20:32.292 --> 00:20:33.167
A lot.


